WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.645
If the team knows what should happen but execution keeps breaking between meetings, this is the operating fix.

00:00:06.645 --> 00:00:11.814
The Revenue Operating Sprint installs a working execution rhythm around a defined revenue result.

00:00:11.814 --> 00:00:17.351
It is for teams with strategy and capable people, but inconsistent ownership, handoffs, or follow-through.

00:00:17.351 --> 00:00:25.473
We diagnose the breakdown, define the minimum operating process, assign ownership, and work alongside the team until the new motion produces evidence.

00:00:25.473 --> 00:00:33.595
The process stays as close as possible to how the team already works, so adoption does not depend on rebuilding the company.

00:00:33.595 --> 00:00:41.717
The proof is visible in the operating record: faster follow-up, clearer ownership, fewer stalled handoffs, and pipeline movement tied to the sprint.

00:00:41.717 --> 00:00:47.205
If execution inconsistency is costing revenue, book a qualified fifteen-minute conversation and bring the bottleneck.
